{
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## S03 · 2 Safe conditions\n*Guide: Step 2.*",
      "id": "class_s03_safe_0"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### ⚠ Feedback from the engine\n{{fbSafe}}",
      "conditional": {
        "hide": "=fbSafe = null or fbSafe = \"\""
      },
      "id": "class_s03_safe_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "separator",
      "id": "class_s03_safe_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### Done when\n- your condition in question 4 is valid FEEL\n- it gives false when days is missing, false with 5 and true with 20",
      "id": "class_s03_safe_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "separator",
      "id": "class_s03_safe_4"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### Questions\nAnswer from what you saw.",
      "id": "class_s03_safe_5"
    },
    {
      "type": "radio",
      "key": "sc1",
      "label": "1. A gateway has the condition canHandle = true and a default flow. canHandle does not exist. What happens?",
      "values": [
        {
          "label": "The condition is false: the default flow is taken",
          "value": "default"
        },
        {
          "label": "Incident: the variable is missing",
          "value": "incident"
        },
        {
          "label": "The condition is true",
          "value": "true"
        }
      ],
      "validate": {
        "required": true
      },
      "id": "class_s03_safe_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "radio",
      "key": "sc2",
      "label": "2. Now the condition is deliveryDays > 2 and deliveryDays does not exist. What happens?",
      "values": [
        {
          "label": "The condition is false: the default flow is taken",
          "value": "default"
        },
        {
          "label": "Incident: the gateway needs true or false and gets null",
          "value": "incident"
        },
        {
          "label": "The engine takes deliveryDays as 0",
          "value": "zero"
        }
      ],
      "validate": {
        "required": true
      },
      "id": "class_s03_safe_7"
    },
    {
      "type": "radio",
      "key": "sc3",
      "label": "3. In BPMN, where is a condition written?",
      "values": [
        {
          "label": "On the sequence flow (the arrow) that leaves the gateway",
          "value": "flow"
        },
        {
          "label": "On the gateway",
          "value": "gateway"
        },
        {
          "label": "On the task after the gateway",
          "value": "task"
        }
      ],
      "validate": {
        "required": true
      },
      "id": "class_s03_safe_8"
    },
    {
      "type": "textfield",
      "key": "feelSafe",
      "label": "4. Type a condition that is true when days is greater than 14, and false (not an error) when days is missing.",
      "validate": {
        "required": true
      },
      "id": "class_s03_safe_9"
    }
  ],
  "type": "default",
  "id": "class-s03-safe",
  "executionPlatform": "Camunda Cloud",
  "executionPlatformVersion": "8.9.0",
  "schemaVersion": 18
}
